 "body": "# Enterprise Rollout — Acme\n\nA **custom page type** (`deal`) this wiki defined in `wiki.templates.local.yaml`.\nThe kit never shipped `deal`; the cockpit still renders it, gives it a crystal in\nthe world, and centers it through the four lenses in Focus.\n\n## Stage\n\nNegotiation → pilot agreed for Q3.\n\n## Why this deal (Intention)\n\nDriven by [Adopt Usage-Based Pricing](../../decisions/adopt-usage-based-pricing.md).\n\n## What we see (Perception)\n\n[Users Drop At Onboarding Step 3](../../claims/onboarding-drop.md) shapes the\nrollout plan.\n\n## What we are doing (Practice)\n\n[Update Pricing Docs](../../actions/update-pricing-page.md) before the pilot.\n\n## Who (Relations)\n\nOwner: [Alex Operator](../../people/alex-operator.md).\n",
